    /**
     * Couple matching data in one call (60 credits), numbers identical to the separate routes:
     * ashtakoota (every koota), navamsa_compat, mangal_dosha of both plus pair status,
     * seventh_house facts of both (7th sign, occupants, 7th lord, Venus, Jupiter, D9 7th, D7 5th),
     * and sade_sati windows of both for 10 years from from. include=kundli_facts adds both full
     * charts. Ids only, no text: planets sun..ketu, sign_index 0-based (Aries=0), house 1-based
     * whole-sign from the lagna, nakshatra index 0-based (Ashwini=0).
     *
     * Cost: 60 credits per call.
     *
     * `GET /v1/milan/summary`
     *
     * @param array{date: string, time: string, tz: string, lat: float|int, lon: float|int} $boy
     *     Groom's birth details, sent as `boy.date`, `boy.time`, `boy.tz`, `boy.lat`, `boy.lon`.
     * @param array{date: string, time: string, tz: string, lat: float|int, lon: float|int} $girl
