     *     `girl.lon`.
     * @param Ayanamsa|string|null $ayanamsa Ayanamsa (sidereal offset) to use. Defaults to lahiri.
     * @param string|null $from Start of the 10-year Sade Sati range, YYYY-MM-DD (local midnight).
     *     Defaults to now.
     * @param string|null $tz Time zone: IANA name (`Asia/Kolkata`) or UTC offset (`+05:30`).
     * @param string|null $include Optional: kundli_facts embeds both partners'
